<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113737" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελῑδ-όνιος</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελῑδ-όνειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Poll.
			6.81
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of the
				swallow,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. τεῖχος</span>
			<i>built by swallows,</i> Thrasyll. ap. Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fluv.</u>
				16.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>like the swallow,</i> esp. <i>coloured like the swallow's
				throat, reddish-brown, russet,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχάδες χελιδόνιαι</span>
			<i>russet-coloured</i> figs, Philem.Gloss. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.652f
			</span></i>., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.32
			</span></i>, Poll.l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					<u>Eup.</u>
					1.228
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελιδόνια</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῦκα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				569.4
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελιδόνεια</span> Epigen.<i><span class="en">
				1.2
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελιδονία, ἡ,</span> a kind of <i>gem,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				37.155
			</span></i>; <i>lapis chelidonius</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				11.203
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ἀσπίς,</span> a kind of <i>asp,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philum.
				<u>Ven.</u>
				16.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.235
			</span></i>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελιδονιαῖος.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δασύπους χελιδόνειος,</span> of the
			common hare, <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελιδονεία κύλιξ,</span> name of a kind
			of cup, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).154
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				7
			</span></i> (pl., Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				145.46
			</span></i> (ib., iv. B.C.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Delos</u>
				385a53
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελιδόνιον, τό,</span> an eye-salve, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIL</u>
				13.10021.93
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
